              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arik’ Umugabane w’ aba Yakobo we si kw ameze, kukw ari we Muremyi wa vyose; kand’ Abisirayeli ni bo muryango yagize ishamvu yiwe: Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo ni ryo zina ryiwe.",
          "type": "text",
