              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw abungere bācitse ibiyingiyingi, ntibagīsha Uhoraho inama: ni co cababujije kumererwa neza, kand’ imikuku yabo yose yarasābagiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
