              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umve ijwi ry’impuha, ngw imivurungano ikomeye iraje, ivuye mu gihugu c’i burārūko, kugira ngw ibisagara vy’i Buyuda bigirwe imisaka, habe i wabo w’imbgebge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
