        {
          "text": "Rekurira uburake bgawe ku mahanga atakuzi, no ku miryango itambaza izina ryawe, kuko bātsontsomeye aba Yakobo, mbere barabatsontsomeye barabaherengeteza, bākomvomvoye aho bāba.",
